Subject: [PATCH 16/49] rocket: RK3568 FEATURE_GRAINS formula for narrow
 outputs; vendor add config

FEATURE_GRAINS: the vendor's 51 mobilenet_v1 tasks match
stride_y + kh + stride_y * ((Wout < 28) + (Wout < 14)); with the plain
stride+kh value a 7x7 conv starts the MAC before the first weight group
is in CBUF and oc0-15 read run-to-run-unstable garbage (mobilenet_v2
op49).  RKT_GRAINS / RKT_GRAINS_OLD override for probing.

Fused residual add rewritten from the RK3588 hardcoded scale table to
the RK3568 vendor configuration (resnet18 capture): EW_CFG raw
0x900000d0 (+RELU bypass for linear adds), ERDMA_CFG raw 0x40000000,
EW base/line/surf strides in raw bytes over the 8ch-planar second
input, and the EW converter computed as s2/(si*sw) with the same
15-bit mantissa rule as OUT_CVT (the vendor encodes 366.0 as
23423 >> 6).  OUT_CVT is now shared between the add and plain paths.
