With the notch in place the banded-add gate in the teflon frontend is
not needed any more: mobilenet_v2 runs all ten adds on the NPU, top-5
matches the CPU including order, mean |logit diff| 0.98 -> 0.82, 14 ms.
mobilenet_v1, the layer suite and the conv-tiny models are unchanged.
