computed inside the partition and the tflite order puts the 1x1 skip
convolution after the main path: fusing into the first producer made
the EW read a tensor that had not been written yet (the vendor fuses
into the 1x1 s2 skip convolutions -- its resnet18 tasks 8/13/18).
The C%32 kernel-padding helper follows the same later-producer rule.

