surfaces, weight layout, int8), the DPU BS-stream requantization, a
table of the settings that look arbitrary but are load-bearing (each
with the lab-log test that established it), the debug knobs and the
method that found the bugs, and what the kernel module changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
