- teflon: one pipe_context per partition instead of one per invoke
  (creating and destroying it cost ~2.5 ms per inference on rocket).
- rocket: the input packing and output unpacking move 8-byte pixels in
  and out of the uncached BO mappings instead of single bytes (ARGB rows
  are memcpy'd, or XORed 8 bytes at a time for int8 input).
- RKT_PROF=1 prints the phase timing of every invoke (pack, submit, wait,
  unpack) and the task mix of the chain.

yolov8n_int8: delegate time 13.5 -> 11 ms (pack 2.0 -> 1.3, unpack
2.4 -> 1.1, the NPU itself 8.2 ms); end to end 18.4 -> 16.4 ms.
